Files:
- vision_fp16.onnx, text_fp16.onnx, tokenizer.json: unchanged copies of the files at
  https://huggingface.co/CardAnvilModels/sam3-ONNX, commit 7eee2d79268e794e433b6e49467c5340525ac228. The encoders
  are ONNX format conversions of facebook/sam3 by Card Anvil, distributed by them under the SAM License; the
  tokenizer is copied unchanged from facebook/sam3.
- detector_fp32_nosign.onnx, detector_fp16_nosign.onnx: modified derivative works of facebook/sam3
  (model.safetensors sha256 6d06f0a5f84e435071fe6603e61d0b4cc7b40e0d39d487cfd4d67d8cc11cc14a, the same weights as
  the Card Anvil export). fp32: the DETR detector graph exported to ONNX by this project, with the Sign operators
  rewritten into equivalent arithmetic and the exporter's metadata removed. fp16: Card Anvil's detector_fp16.onnx
  (same commit as above) with the same Sign rewrite and metadata removal. Scripts and commands: tools/models/ in
  https://github.com/jbarlo/eyespy.
